/span></span></nav></header></div><p role="status" class="min-h-6 text-ink"></p><main class="pb-8"><section class="space-y-6" aria-labelledby="plus-start"><div><h2 id="plus-start" tabindex="-1" class="text-3xl font-semibold text-ink">Willkommen bei Plus!</h2><p class="mt-1 text-lg text-ink-muted">Rechnen im Kopf. Ohne Uhr, ohne Druck.</p></div><div class="grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1.6fr)_minmax(0,1fr)]"><section aria-labelledby="plus-training" class="flex flex-col gap-4 rounded-2xl border-2 p-6 border-transparent" style="background: rgb(var(--c-accent-solid)); color: rgb(var(--c-on-accent));"><p class="m-0 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide opacity-90">Mein Training</p><h3 id="plus-training" class="m-0 text-2xl font-semibold">Plus sucht die Aufgaben aus.</h3><p class="m-0 opacity-90">8 Aufgaben je Runde. Keine Uhr.</p><button type="button" class="btn self-start bg-surface-raised px-6 text-lg font-semibold text-accent hover:bg-surface-sunken">Los geht's<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><polyline points="9 18 15 12 9 6"></polyline></svg></button></section><div class="flex flex-col gap-4"><section aria-labelledby="plus-woche" class="card flex items-center gap-4 p-5"><svg viewBox="0 0 64 64" class="h-16 w-16 shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="32" cy="32" r="26" fill="none" stroke-width="8" class="stroke-accent-soft"></circle><circle cx="32" cy="32" r="26" fill="none" stroke-width="8" stroke-linecap="round" class="stroke-accent" stroke-dasharray="0.0 163.4" transform="rotate(-90 32 32)"></circle></svg><div><h3 id="plus-woche" class="m-0 text-lg font-semibold text-ink">Wochenziel</h3><p class="m-0 text-ink-muted">Diese Woche: 0 von 50 Aufgaben.</p></div></section></div></div><section aria-labelledby="plus-oder" class="space-y-3"><h3 id="plus-oder" class="m-0 text-lg font-semibold text-ink-muted">Oder lieber …</h3><ul class="m-0 grid list-none gap-3 p-0 sm:grid-cols-3"><li><button type="button" class="card flex min-h-[44px] w-full items-center gap-4 p-4 text-left text-ink hover:bg-surface-sunken"><span class="flex h-11 w-11 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-accent-soft text-accent"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><line x1="8" y1="6" x2="21" y2="6"></line><line x1="8" y1="12" x2="21" y2="12"></line><line x1="8" y1="18" x2="21" y2="18"></line><line x1="3" y1="6" x2="3.01" y2="6"></line><line x1="3" y1="12" x2="3.01" y2="12"></line><line x1="3" y1="18" x2="3.01" y2="18"></line></svg></span><span><span class="block text-lg font-semibold">Ich wähle</span><span class="block text-ink-muted">Such dir eine Übung aus.</span></span></button></li><li><button type="button" class="card flex min-h-[44px] w-full items-center gap-4 p-4 text-left text-ink hover:bg-surface-sunken"><span class="flex h-11 w-11 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-accent-soft text-accent"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="m12 3-1.9 5.8a2 2 0 0 1-1.3 1.3L3 12l5.8 1.9a2 2 0 0 1 1.3 1.3L12 21l1.9-5.8a2 2 0 0 1 1.3-1.3L21 12l-5.8-1.9a2 2 0 0 1-1.3-1.3L12 3Z"></path><path d="M5 3v4"></path><path d="M19 17v4"></path><path d="M3 5h4"></path><path d="M17 19h4"></path></svg></span><span><span class="block text-lg font-semibold">Spiele</span><span class="block text-ink-muted">Rechnen, aber anders.</span></span></button></li><li><button type="button" class="card flex min-h-[44px] w-full items-center gap-4 p-4 text-left text-ink hover:bg-surface-sunken"><span class="flex h-11 w-11 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-accent-soft text-accent"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M4 19.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 6.5 17H20"></path><path d="M6.5 2H20v20H6.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 4 19.5v-15A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 6.5 2z"></path></svg></span><span><span class="block text-lg font-semibold">Meine Sammlung</span><span class="block text-ink-muted">Abzeichen und Wochenziel.</span></span></button></li></ul></section><p class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 text-ink-muted">Melde dich an. Dann ist dein Weg auf jedem Gerät da.<button type="button" class="btn-secondary">Anmelden</button></p></section></main><footer aria-label="Rechtliches" class="mt-10 text-center text-xs text-ink-muted"><a class="underline underline-offset-2" href="/datenschutz">Datenschutz</a> · <a class="underline underline-offset-2" href="/impressum">Impressum</a></footer></div></div>"`;

exports[`Deutsch bleibt gleich - die Seite ohne Probe-Schalter > die Bausteine einzeln: Stufenwahl, Wahl, Start > baustein-start 1`] = `"<section class="space-y-6" aria-labelledby="plus-start"><div><h2 id="plus-start" tabindex="-1" class="text-3xl font-semibold text-ink">Hallo Mia!</h2><p class="mt-1 text-lg text-ink-muted">Schön, dass du wieder da bist.</p></div><div class="grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1.6fr)_minmax(0,1fr)]"><section aria-labelledby="plus-training" class="flex flex-col gap-4 rounded-2xl border-2 p-6 border-transparent" style="background: rgb(var(--c-accent-solid)); color: rgb(var(--c-on-accent));"><p class="m-0 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide opacity-90">Mein Training</p><h3 id="plus-training" class="m-0 text-2xl font-semibold">Plus sucht die Aufgaben aus.</h3><p class="m-0 opacity-90">8 Aufgaben je Runde. Keine Uhr.</p><button type="button" class="btn self-start bg-surface-raised px-6 text-lg font-semibold text-accent hover:bg-surface-sunken">Los geht's<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><polyline points="9 18 15 12 9 6"></polyline></svg></button></section><div class="flex flex-col gap-4"><section aria-labelledby="plus-woche" class="card flex items-center gap-4 p-5"><svg viewBox="0 0 64 64" class="h-16 w-16 shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="32" cy="32" r="26" fill="none" stroke-width="8" class="stroke-accent-soft"></circle><circle cx="32" cy="32" r="26" fill="none" stroke-width="8" stroke-linecap="round" class="stroke-accent" stroke-dasharray="54.5 163.4" transform="rotate(-90 32 32)"></circle></svg><div><h3 id="plus-woche" class="m-0 text-lg font-semibold text-ink">Wochenziel</h3><p class="m-0 text-ink-muted">Diese Woche: 1 von 3 Aufgaben.</p></div></section></div></div><section aria-labelledby="plus-oder" class="space-y-3"><h3 id="plus-oder"