n="richtig" class="tt-uebungsschrift block resize-none rounded-[1.5rem] w-full overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre rounded-tr-lg border-[3px] py-3 pl-5 pr-16 font-legible text-ink plus-fx-richtig border-success bg-success-soft" style="font-size: 1.75rem; line-height: 1.3; transition: border-color 150ms, background-color 250ms;" aria-describedby="plus-aufgabe plus-eingabe-art plus-eingabe-gelesen plus-eingabe-tasten"></textarea><span aria-hidden="true" class="plus-fx-zeichen pointer-events-none absolute right-4 top-4 grid h-11 w-11 place-items-center rounded-full bg-success text-surface-raised"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" width="24" height="24" stroke-width="3"><path d="M5 12.5l4.5 4.5L19 7.5"></path></svg></span></div><p role="status" class="-mt-1 flex min-h-7 items-center gap-2 text-lg font-bold text-success"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" width="22" height="22" stroke-width="3"><path d="M5 12.5l4.5 4.5L19 7.5"></path></svg><span>Richtig.</span></p><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2"><button type="button" class="plus-knopf plus-knopf-zweit plus-knopf-klein"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" width="22" height="22" stroke-width="2"><path d="M4 9.5h3.5L12 5.5v13l-4.5-4H4z"></path><path d="M15.5 9a4.2 4.2 0 010 6M18 6.5a8 8 0 010 11"></path></svg>Aufgabe noch einmal ansagen</button></div></div><details class="rounded-2xl border border-hairline bg-surface-raised px-4 py-2 text-ink"><summary class="cursor-pointer font-bold">Tasten für diese Übung</summary><ul id="plus-eingabe-tasten" class="m-0 mt-2 list-none space-y-1 p-0 text-sm text-ink-soft"><li>Alt + B wechselt die Eingabeart</li><li>Alt + Plus größer · Alt + Minus kleiner · Alt + 0 zurück</li><li>Umschalttaste zweimal: Aufgabe noch einmal - die Rechnung steht wieder im Feld</li></ul></details></div></div><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3"><button type="button" class="plus-knopf plus-knopf-haupt"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" width="26" height="26" stroke-width="3"><path d="M5 12.5l4.5 4.5L19 7.5"></path></svg>Prüfen</button><button type="button" class="plus-knopf plus-knopf-leise plus-knopf-klein">Aufgabe überspringen</button><button type="button" class="plus-knopf plus-knopf-leise ml-auto">Übung beenden</button></div></section>"`;
